            <p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#334155;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;"><strong>Ada Lovelace</strong> invited you to collaborate on <strong>Analytical Engine</strong> in Proyekto.</p>
            <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:0 0 16px;">
